# SpendWise has no .env settings of its own any more.
#
# Configuration lives in wrangler.jsonc (bindings and plain vars):
#   DB                D1 database "spendwise-db"
#   AUTH_LIMITER      rate limit for sign-in attempts
#   CF_AI_WORKER_URL  URL of the spendwise-ai worker
#
# Secrets go in .dev.vars for local development (gitignored) and are set with
# `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` for production:
#
#   CF_AI_WORKER_SECRET=<same value as API_SECRET on the spendwise-ai worker>
